/*
  PowertrainPanel.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0283 · PowertrainPanel (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `PowertrainPanel` resolves (table "PowertrainPanel") lives here with its web
  `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog.

  The first group is the exact set of keys extracted from the web source
  (features/vehicles/components/telemetry-panels/PowertrainPanel.tsx). The second
  group backs the native chrome (the P4 leaf freshness / loading / error copy), so the
  Swift sources hold no English prose literals. Unit symbols ("kW", "Nm", "RPM", "°C",
  "°F") and the numeric "-300" / "0" / "+300" power-axis markers are SI/scale literals
  carried in code, not translated strings.
*/

